exports[`NewspaperRenderer > renderText matches the snapshot 1`] = `
"THE DAYLIGHT LEDGER
All the news that fits the roll
================================================
Tuesday, November 24, 2026 · No. 142 · 41°/22°
================================================
WEATHER: Light snow 41°/22° precip 65%
Snow tapers by noon; roads slick before 9.
TODAY:
  9:00 AM  Staff sync
  12:30 PM  Lunch with the planning committee at the usual place
